{"repositoryId":1281944507,"availability":"available","full":"raman-codes-6368/CoverPlay","name":"CoverPlay","description":"CoverPlay is an ad free open source media player designed to bring order to your video collection. CoverPlay provides a sleek, dark-themed interface that keeps your focus on your media. ​Key Features: ​Centralized Organization , Intuitive History Tracking , Simplified Navigation and Elegant Dark Mode.","category":"Design","language":"Kotlin","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-27T05:42:46Z","updated":"2026-10-17T07:38:11Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://raman-codes-6368.github.io/CoverPlay/","topics":["android","exoplayer","jetpack-compose","kotlin","media-player","media3","open-source","video-player"],"demo":"https://raman-codes-6368.github.io/CoverPlay/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:58.339Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:58.339Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:58.339Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T18:53:58.339Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A video player that looks as good as your videos.","Most video players make you choose: clean or capable, free or respectful. CoverPlay doesn't."],"features":["Clean, modern controls: bare icons with soft shadows, minimal gradients, and a single hero play button. Nothing covers your video.","Compact gesture feedback: short, quiet pills like Fit, Paused, 2x, not noisy popups.","Aspect modes: Fit, Fill and Zoom in a tap.","Smooth scrubber with chapter support and a live preview card.","Playback speed control, plus long-press for 2x and release to return."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/raman-codes-6368/CoverPlay/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ae51a4bbb3ac53c3a1003aa01c42dfe4555aa292a1f921e5e11b301a5d894b9f","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:58.443Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:58.443Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A video player that